{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every round reshuffles the balance of power. </strong>Losers get stronger, winners get targeted, and no lead is ever safe. <i>Robots with Guns</i> is built around an endless tug of war where survival matters more than raw power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robots don\u2019t argue. They shoot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when they lose, they rebuild with better parts and bigger guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into <strong>short, fast-paced combat rounds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win a round and <strong>your opponents receive powerful upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose a round and <strong>scavenge new gear to fight back</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build powerful combinations <strong>and adapt your playstyle with different weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outplay the imbalance and <strong>prove your mastery by winning while weaker</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no fixed number of rounds - <strong>play endlessly and let the chaos decide when it\u2019s over.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ Unique Items</strong> - ridiculous weapons and game-changing upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Maps</strong> - compact arenas designed for constant action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactable Environment</strong> - spikes, hazards, and deadly traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer Mayhem </strong>- perfect for couch play and party nights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Controls</strong> - up to 4 controllers + 2 keyboa